{"id":"n4-082","title":"～すぎる","romaji":"〜sugiru","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Expresses that something is excessive or overdone; 'too much', 'too', 'over'.","longExplanation":"The ～すぎる grammar point is used to express that something is excessive or beyond a certain level. It can be translated as 'too much', 'too', or 'over' in English. The formation differs depending on whether it is used with a verb, い-adjective, or な-adjective.","formation":"Verb-stem + すぎる, い-Adjective (remove い) + すぎる, な-Adjective + すぎる","examples":[{"jp":"この部屋は暑すぎる。","romaji":"Kono heya wa atsui sugiru.","en":"This room is too hot.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"部屋","vocabId":"1499320","reading":"へや"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"暑すぎる","vocabId":"1343460","reading":"あつすぎる","baseForm":"暑い"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼は早く来すぎた。","romaji":"Kare wa hayaku kisugita.","en":"He came too early.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"早く","vocabId":"1404975","reading":"はやく","baseForm":"早い"},{"surface":"来すぎた","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"きすぎた","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"この箱は重すぎて持ち上げられない。","romaji":"Kono hako wa omosugite mochiagerarenai.","en":"This box is too heavy to lift.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"箱","vocabId":"1585650","reading":"はこ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"重すぎて","vocabId":"1335750","reading":"おもすぎて","baseForm":"重い"},{"surface":"持ち上げ","vocabId":"1315610","reading":"もちあげ","baseForm":"持ち上げる"},{"surface":"られ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"られる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼女は忙しくて遊びすぎはしない。","romaji":"Kanojo wa isogashikute asobisugi wa shinai.","en":"She's too busy to play too much.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"忙しくて","vocabId":"1519290","reading":"いそがしくて","baseForm":"忙しい"},{"surface":"遊び","vocabId":"1542070","reading":"あそび"},{"surface":"すぎ","vocabId":"1195960","reading":"すぎ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]}]}